msgid ""
"ngrok provides a simple way to get started with the Quarkus Let's Encrypt "
"ACME feature."
msgstr ""

msgid "Start testing by reserving a domain in ngrok:"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"You can reserve the domain by using link:https://github.com/quarkiverse/"
"quarkus-ngrok[Quarkiverse ngrok] in dev mode or by reserving it directly in "
"the ngrok dashboard.\n"
"You cannot use the ngrok domain to test the Quarkus Let's Encrypt ACME "
"feature immediately."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"ngrok uses Let's Encrypt and intercepts ACME challenges that the Quarkus "
"application would otherwise handle."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Therefore, remove the ngrok Let's Encrypt certificate policy from your ngrok "
"domain:"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"`YOUR-RESERVED-DOMAIN-ID` is your reserved domain's ID, which starts from "
"`rd_`; you can find it in the link:https://dashboard.ngrok.com/cloud-edge/"
"domains[ngrok dashboard domains section]."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Because ngrok only forwards ACME challenges over HTTP, start ngrok with the "
"following command:"
